# RSpec standards

## Required coverage

- Model scopes and validations (facet filters, slug generation)
- Service objects and Hanami actions (happy path + failure path)
- Colour distance/ranking logic with fixed fixture palettes
- Request specs for SSR listing (assert artwork tiles in response body without JS)

## Style

```ruby
# ✅ Explicit, one assertion per behaviour
it "filters by style from URL segment" do
  abstract = create(:artwork, style: "abstract")
  create(:artwork, style: "landscape")

  get "/artworks/style/abstract"

  expect(response.body).to include(abstract.title)
  expect(response.body).not_to include("landscape")
end
```

- FactoryBot for fixtures; avoid brittle full-page string matches when id/class selectors suffice
- Stub external HTTP (palette service) in Rails specs; real DB in Hanami specs
- Regression specs for bugs with a comment explaining _why_

## Before finishing a task

Run affected specs. Do not leave failing or untested orchestrator logic.
